# Deployment

## Server Info

- **Server**: root@141.105.68.223
- **App path**: /var/www/journal_app
- **Stack**: Gunicorn (3 workers, port 8001) + Nginx (port 8080), managed by systemd (journal.service)
- **URL**: http://141.105.68.223:8080/
- **SSH**: Key-based auth configured (no password needed)

## Deploy Command

When the user says "деплой", "залей", "выложи", or "deploy":

1. Commit all changes (if uncommitted)
2. Push to GitHub
3. Run on server via SSH:

```
ssh root@141.105.68.223 "cd /var/www/journal_app && git pull && systemctl restart journal.service"
```

## X-Accel-Redirect (быстрая раздача файлов)

После первого деплоя X-Accel-Redirect нужно один раз настроить на сервере:

1. **Nginx** — добавить в server { } (внутри блока server):
   ```
   location /internal-uploads/ {
       internal;
       alias /var/www/journal_app/uploads/articles/;
   }
   ```
   Файл-пример: `nginx-internal-uploads.conf`

2. **systemd** — в `journal.service` добавить в блок `[Service]`:
   ```
   Environment="USE_X_ACCEL_REDIRECT=1"
   Environment="RUN_BACKUP=1"
   ```
   (`RUN_BACKUP=1` — чтобы при старте приложения создавался бэкап и отправлялся в Telegram; локально не задавать.)

3. Перезапустить:
   ```
   sudo nginx -t && sudo systemctl reload nginx
   sudo systemctl daemon-reload && sudo systemctl restart journal.service
   ```

## Important

- Do NOT deploy without user's explicit command (or when user asked to "deploy after each change" — then deploy after completing code changes).
- **Deploy after each change**: if the user said to deploy after every change, run the full deploy flow (commit → push → SSH pull + restart) after each set of edits.
- Always commit before deploying.
- The app runs on plain HTTP (no HTTPS) — do NOT enable SESSION_COOKIE_SECURE
